o Class: Deepseek Offline
=20
https://www.phpclasses.org/package/13464-PHP-Chat-with-DeepSeek-bot-in-the-=
local-machine.html


  Description: Chat with DeepSeek bot in the local machine

  Author: Rodrigo Faustino

  Country: Brazil

  Comment:
    Deepseek LLM is one of the most recent Large Language Models that has
    been used to implement applications based on Artificial Intelligence.

    Usually, the available LLMs can be used via a remote API.

    This package provides a PHP application that can use Ollama to
    implement a chatbot application that responds automatically to user
    queries and run locally to access several types of LLMs engines like
    Deepseek, Gemma and Llama3.
___________________________________________________________________________

o Class: RA KMP Search
=20
https://www.phpclasses.org/package/13538-PHP-Search-text-strings-using-the-=
KMP-algorithm.html


  Description: Search text strings using the KMP algorithm

  Author: Roberto Aleman

  Country: Venezuela

  Comment:
    The Knuth-Morris-Pratt algorithm can be used to perform searches of
    text using a pattern in a way that it quickly can find the next
    occurrence of the pattern after it finds one occurrence.

    This package provides a class that implements the Knuth-Morris-Pratt
    algorithm in PHP.
___________________________________________________________________________

o Class: RA Rabin Karp Search Algorithm
=20
https://www.phpclasses.org/package/13540-PHP-Search-for-text-using-the-Rabi=
n-Karp-algorithm.html


  Description: Search for text using the Rabin-Karp algorithm

  Author: Roberto Aleman

  Country: Venezuela

  Comment:
    Some PHP application need to search text or binary data.

    The Rabin Karp algorithm uses hashes of the data to perform searches
    that scan less data to find matching occurrences of a given search text=
=2E

    This package provides a PHP implementation that can search data as
    plain text or raw binary data or data encoded using hexadecimal
    characters.
___________________________________________________________________________

o Class: Biggidroid WhatsApp CTA for WordPress
=20
https://www.phpclasses.org/package/13541-PHP-Display-WhatsApp-contact-butto=
n-in-WordPress-pages.html


  Description: Display WhatsApp contact button in WordPress pages

  Author: Adeleye Ayodeji

  Country: Nigeria

  Comment:
    WordPress is a very popular content management systems that allow
    developers to implement plugins to extend WordPress capabilities.

    One way to extend WordPress capabilities is to provide better means of
    content to let users contact site owners.

    This package provides a WordPress plugin that makes a WhatsApp contact
    button appear in WordPress site pages to let users send messages to
    site owners just hitting the WhatsApp contact button.
___________________________________________________________________________

o Class: Biggidroid Contact for WordPress
=20
https://www.phpclasses.org/package/13545-PHP-Add-contact-forms-to-WordPress=
-site-pages.html


  Description: Add contact forms to WordPress site pages

  Author: Adeleye Ayodeji

  Country: Nigeria

  Comment:
    The administrators of many sites that use WordPress as a content
    management system would like to provide a means to be contacted by the
    site users without exposing their email addresses publicly.

    A contact form allows implementing that feature.

    This package provides a plugin to let site administrators to add
    contact forms to their WordPress sites.
___________________________________________________________________________

o Class: RA Ultimate Cipher Analyzer
=20
https://www.phpclasses.org/package/13546-PHP-Analyze-and-suggest-the-of-an-=
encrypted-file.html


  Description: Analyze and suggest the of an encrypted file

  Author: Roberto Aleman

  Country: Venezuela

  Comment:
    Sometimes it is necessary to determine the types of files in a
    directory to figure what is the role of those files.

    One of the most difficult challenges in computer security is
    determining which algorithm was used to encrypt a file.

    PHP provides functions to detect certain types of files.

    This package provides a pure PHP analysis tool to detect more types of
    files that can be encrypted.

    It uses different strategies to determine which algorithm was used to
    encrypt a file without knowing the encryption key, the original file
    contents, or the file contents hash.
___________________________________________________________________________

o Class: Docker Compose Auto Scaling Service
=20
https://www.phpclasses.org/package/13552-PHP-Manage-the-deployment-of-servi=
ces-using-Docker.html


  Description: Manage the deployment of services using Docker

  Author: Matheusz Maydana

  Country: Brazil

  Comment:
    Docker is a tool that can deploy containers to run applications in the
    same machine, as if they were different machines.

    Docker can be useful to run many instances of the same PHP application
    when there is a demand to handle the requests of many users to the Web
    server that processes the request to PHP applications.

    This package provides an example Docker container management script
    that uses a PHP script to scale the number of Docker instances that
    handle the accesses to an application.
___________________________________________________________________________

o Class: ATK Wordpress Plugin
=20
https://www.phpclasses.org/package/13557-PHP-Components-to-build-WordPress-=
plugins.html


  Description: Components to build WordPress plugins

  Author: Francesco Danti

  Country: Italy

  Comment:
    WordPress is a popular content management system written in PHP that
    can be extended using plugin packages.

    This package provides a framework with many classes that are useful to
    develop WordPress plugins.
